contact=banner('Contact','Great journeys start<br>with a conversation.','Tell us your ideas, your travel plans or simply what you are curious about. We would love to hear from you.')
contact+=f'''<section class="section"><div class="container contact-layout"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</span><h2>Let's talk travel.</h2><p class="lead">Prism is built for people who want clarity and care, not another endless search tab.</p><p>Use our enquiry form to share your requirements. Whether you're planning a getaway, a group celebration or a work trip, we can discuss the next steps with you.</p><ul class="contact-points"><li><div class="contact-points__icon" aria-hidden="true">✉</div><div><strong>Send an enquiry</strong><span>Share your plans via our online enquiry form.</span></div></li><li><div class="contact-points__icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</div><div><strong>Prefer to meet in person?</strong><span>Request office location details and an appointment through your enquiry.</span></div></li><li><div class="contact-points__icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div><div><strong>Travelling for business?</strong><span>Tell us about your team, dates and travel requirements.</span></div></li></ul></div>
<div class="contact-card reveal"><span class="contact-card__label">START HERE</span><h3>Send us your travel enquiry.</h3><p>Our enquiry form is the most direct way to share your requirements. No payment or booking happens on this website.</p>{btn('Open the enquiry form')}<p class="contact-note">The button opens a Google Form in a new tab. Your details are sent only when you submit that form.</p><hr class="rule" style="margin:31px 0"><span class="contact-card__label">OPTIONAL TRIP PLANNER</span><h3 style="font-size:1.25rem">Prepare a trip brief</h3><p class="small">Create a short summary to copy into your enquiry. Nothing is transmitted from this page.</p>
<form data-trip-planner><div class="field-row"><div class="field"><label for="destination">Where to?</label><input id="destination" name="destination" maxlength="100" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Kerala"></div><div class="field"><label for="period">When?</label><input id="period" name="period" maxlength="100" type="text" placeholder="e.g. January 2027"></div></div><div class="field-row"><div class="field"><label for="travellers">Travellers</label><input id="travellers" name="travellers" maxlength="50" type="text" placeholder="e.g. 2 adults"></div><div class="field"><label for="style">Type of travel</label><select id="style" name="style"><option value="">Select</option><option>Holiday</option><option>Business</option><option>Wedding / Celebration</option><option>Group / Event</option><option>Other</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="notes">Anything else?</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" maxlength="800" placeholder="Interests, budget range, preferences..."></textarea></div><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare &amp; copy trip brief <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button><p class="field-hint" data-copy-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Your information stays on this page unless you choose to share it.</p><div class="trip-result" data-trip-result aria-label="Your trip brief"></div></form></div></div></section>'''
