privacy=banner('Privacy','Your information.<br>Handled thoughtfully.','A plain-language overview of how enquiries and personal information work on this website.')
privacy+=f'''<section class="section"><div class="container legal-content"><p class="lead">We respect the importance of your personal travel details. This page explains how this particular website operates and where information may be shared.</p>
<h2>1. Information you provide</h2><p>Prism Travels links to an external Google Form for enquiries. When you submit that form, you may provide your name, contact details, travel dates, destination, preferences and other information requested by the form. Please avoid submitting sensitive personal documents unless specifically required through a verified process.</p>
<h2>2. How the enquiry information is used</h2><p>Information submitted through the enquiry form is intended to help the travel team understand your request, discuss options and follow up on your enquiry. Contact the team through the form if you have questions about the use, correction or deletion of information previously supplied.</p>
<h2>3. The on-page trip brief</h2><p>The optional trip brief generator on the contact page runs in your browser. It prepares text for you to copy and does not send information to a Prism server. Clipboard permissions depend on your browser settings.</p>
<h2>4. Third-party tools and resources</h2><p>This website uses Google Fonts and loads travel photography from Unsplash. The enquiry link opens Google Forms. These providers may receive technical connection data and have their own privacy terms. You can read <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://unsplash.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash's privacy information</a>.</p>
<h2>5. Cookies and analytics</h2><p>The provided website code does not install Prism-owned analytics, tracking pixels or advertising cookies. External providers may process technical data as described in their policies. Any future addition of analytics or marketing services should be reflected in an updated privacy notice.</p>
<h2>6. Questions</h2><p>To raise a privacy-related question, <a href="{FORM}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact Prism through the enquiry form</a> and clearly state that the question concerns your information.</p>
<p class="small">Updated November 2026.</p></div></section>'''
terms=banner('Website Terms','Clear expectations.<br>Better journeys.','How to use Prism Travels’ information and enquiry website.')
terms+=f'''<section class="section"><div class="container legal-content"><p class="lead">The Prism Travels website helps you discover travel services and start a conversation. It does not itself issue tickets or confirm bookings.</p>
<h2>1. Website purpose</h2><p>Destination descriptions, service information and images are provided for general inspiration. They are not binding offers, quotations, booking confirmations or guarantees of availability.</p>
<h2>2. Travel enquiries</h2><p>Submitting an enquiry through the linked Google Form does not book travel or create a payment obligation. Before arranging travel, confirm the proposed itinerary, prices, schedule, inclusions, cancellation conditions and any supplier-specific terms directly with the team.</p>
<h2>3. Current travel requirements</h2><p>Flights, visas, entry rules, hotels and other travel conditions may change. Check the latest official rules and your final booking documents before travel. Government bodies and third-party suppliers are responsible for their own decisions and services.</p>
<h2>4. External services</h2><p>This website links to external providers, such as Google Forms, and loads third-party images and fonts. Those services remain subject to their own terms and policies.</p>
<h2>5. Intellectual property</h2><p>Prism branding and original website text are intended for Prism Travels. Third-party destination images remain the property of their respective rights holders and are used subject to applicable licences.</p>
<h2>6. Queries about bookings</h2><p>If you need transaction-specific details or have a question about a quoted itinerary, ask for the applicable written terms before proceeding. This website's general terms do not replace any separate booking agreement.</p>
<p class="small">Updated November 2026.</p></div></section>'''
